Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-cli, php-spojenet-abraflexi, php-spojenet-ipex-b2b, php-vitexsoftware-ease-core
Description: Add IPEX VoIP credit for paid AbraFlexi invoices
 Reads a paid AbraFlexi issued invoice with the KREDIT_VOIP item and adds
 the ordered prepaid credit to the VoIP number in IPEX (numbers come from
 the order.json attachment). The "API" label of the invoice is removed only
 after all credits were added.

